# Korriban, the landing and the Valley of Dark Lords (TSL, 003EBO, 701KOR,
# to 710KOR): the galaxy map to Korriban, the landing talk aboard (Atton,
# Visas if she is aboard, Kreia: she will not walk Korriban's surface and
# keeps the engines primed, no -INF), ashore with Atton and Bao-Dur (Kreia
# cannot be picked: 701KOR's OnEnter takes her selectability away), the
# intro walk off the ramp with Kreia's voice over the plundered tombs, down
# the valley past the tombs and the skeletal corpses to the shyrack cave;
# the party's banter at its mouth, Kreia's advice (or her "not yet strong
# enough"), the two shyracks that come out, and into the cave.
# Starts from Onderon's first visit, the Ebon Hawk at Dxun:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @onderon_first_done data/routes/tsl/korriban_valley.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Korriban" and "Valley of the Dark Lords"
# (context/walkthroughs/tsl/); DSimpson's order: the cave and the tomb first,
# the Academy last.
# Left: the skeletal corpses (corpse_tr_hss*: each searched brings two
# cloaked Hssiss; a fight for random loot), Kreia's tomb histories off the
# way (tr_hist_pall's Light Side reply needs Awareness, see korriban.md).
#
# ASSUMES:
# - The save is aboard the Ebon Hawk (003EBO), the galaxy map free, no
#   cutscene of the Hawk's own queued before it. # UNSURE: @onderon_first_done
#   is drafted by another agent; if it ends on Dxun's jungle landing, walk
#   aboard first.
# - Atton (NPC 0) and Bao-Dur (NPC 1) are in the party table and selectable.
# - Korriban is open on the galaxy map (planetary.2da row 3).
# - The landing talk (kor_int, 003EBO) starts aboard on landing as Dantooine's
#   and Nar Shaddaa's did. # UNSURE: no script seen naming kor_int; a_kor_int
#   (its own action) only plays the movie and the fades.
# - The ramp's party selection screen is TSL's usual (`to tr_leave`, as in
#   dantooine_khoonda). # UNSURE: kor_int ends on a_next_scene, which may
#   itself move the party out; then `party` waits for the next screen.
use Galaxymap
travel 3             # Korriban (planetary.2da)
say Let's head out, then. # kor_int: the landing talk
say Why won't you come with me?
say Korriban doesn't look that bad. I'm not afraid.
say Very well. Stay here and keep the engines primed # (not "Fine. I didn't want your company anyway", -INF)
talk
party 0,1            # Atton and Bao-Dur (Kreia is unselectable on Korriban)
to tr_leave          # the ramp: the party screen, accepted
module 701kor
talk                 # tr_intro: Kreia's voice as the party walks off the ramp (kreia_kr)
# Kreia's corpse warnings (corpse_warn, kreia_kr's "What are these
# guardians?" first, not "These creatures shouldn't be much challenge.", -INF)
# and the history by the excavation (tr_hist_excav) may start on the way:
# their first replies are safe.
to tr_cave_banter    # the party at the cave's mouth, Kreia's advice (kreia_cv)
talk
fight 20             # the two shyracks her scene spawns (tr_shyrak, sp_g_shyrack)
exit To_710          # the Shyrack Cave
module 710kor
save korriban_cave
